  "id": "phonological-dyslexia",
  "term": "phonological dyslexia",
  "definition": "Phonological dyslexia is described here as a recognized subtype of dyslexia. In this framework, it can be understood as especially low performance on one reading-related component within a broader, continuous assessment of reading rather than as a completely separate category.",
